      "location": "答23双线等式的有限和",
      "original": "u^{\\binom{n+1}{2}}\\sum_{k=0}^{2n}v^k",
      "final": "u^{\\binom{n+1}{2}}v^{\\binom n2}\\sum_{k=0}^{2n}v^k",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "basis": "两版次行同缺始幂。因上、下指数之差为2n+1，按等比和得该因子。n=2的非零次数为1至5。v=1取有限多项式值2n+1。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 629,
