      "location": "答24(c)两人关于分划秩定理的期刊年份",
      "original": "(3) 4 (1953)",
      "final": "(3) **4**（1954）",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": true,
      "authorChangeDate": "2022-11-10",
      "basis": "作者变化记录第10页对英印751、答24第9行，明确改4(1953)为4(1954)。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 629,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "58a10b926d34484bb96d1f90e5c9384dd7b7c800c0526fe8b215cef9148c28b5"
