      "cnPdfPage": 645,
      "enPdfPages": [
        768
      ],
      "location": "答25(a)上下限确定的积分",
      "original": "\\int_1^x f(x)\\,dx=-\\operatorname{Li}_2(e^{-tx})/t",
      "final": "\\int_1^x f(y)\\,dy=\\frac{\\operatorname{Li}_2(e^{-t})-\\operatorname{Li}_2(e^{-tx})}{t}",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "basis": "t>0且x≥1时，原右端的导数确为f(x)，其x=1值非零。补下限常数使x=1归零，x→∞时给随后欧拉求和使用的Li₂(e⁻ᵗ)/t。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 630,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "fa3050cd72d711a0db10327d26174d390bc9b41dbef643b9461f2734587a8dad"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume4a-tail-answer-008",
      "section": "7.2.1.4",
      "cnPdfPage": 645,
      "enPdfPages": [
        768
      ],
      "location": "答25(b)的z=−1留数链",
      "original": "-\\zeta(-1)\\zeta(0)t=B_2B_1t=-t/24",
      "final": "-\\zeta(-1)\\zeta(0)t=-t/24",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "basis": "两版原链的ζ端点给−t/24。作者2021年修订的中项−B₂B₁t/2在卷1印89式(4)(5)约定下却为+t/24。定稿用可直接精确核实的ζ表达与数值，作者修订单独登记。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 630,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "fa3050cd72d711a0db10327d26174d390bc9b41dbef643b9461f2734587a8dad"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume4a-tail-answer-009",
      "section": "7.2.1.4",
      "cnPdfPage": 645,
      "enPdfPages": [
        769
      ],
      "location": "答31固定部分数k的下标",
      "original": "f_{n,n\\bmod k!}(n)",
      "final": "f_{k,n\\bmod k!}(n)",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "basis": "同一行刚定义将k固定、以模k!余数r为次指标的f_{k,r}。定稿恢复该首指标，保持余数和次数。小k各余数的数值核见复核记录。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 630,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "fa3050cd72d711a0db10327d26174d390bc9b41dbef643b9461f2734587a8dad"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume4a-tail-answer-010",
      "section": "7.2.1.4",
      "cnPdfPage": 645,
      "enPdfPages": [
        768
      ],
      "location": "答25(b)同一推导所用的Mellin积分竖线",
      "original": "\\operatorname{Re}z=1",
      "final": "设 $t>0$，取 $c>1$",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "basis": "单个Mellin变换可取正实部。第二积分的ζ(z)有z=1极点，且交换双和用∑m^(−c)∑n^(−c−1)绝对收敛。故前后两式用同一条c>1，后续移线才跨过1。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 630,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "fa3050cd72d711a0db10327d26174d390bc9b41dbef643b9461f2734587a8dad"
    },
    {
