      "location": "答35(d)费希尔—蒂皮特二阶矩的近似末位",
      "original": "1.0656",
      "final": "1.0655",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "basis": "原精确式等于1+((γ−ln C)/C)²，C=π/√6。高精度区间1.065549077460493…至1.065549077460495…全部在四位舍入界1.06555下，直接按四位舍入。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 631,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "83b7907b8e0b8d8a2075b999f211f7e114b49715697b9f26cd757c74cf3877f7"
    }
